%description:
The Indoor Factory scenarios are TR 38.901's: TR 36.814 and TR 36.873 have none. A cell in one of
them on a carrier whose channel model takes its formulas from TR 36.814 was an error that named a
number ("Wrong value 5 for path-loss scenario"). The first evaluation of a link of such a cell is
an error that names the scenario and the study that has it.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

**.radio.scenario = "INDOOR_FACTORY_SL"
# clutter-embedded antennas: both below the 2 m clutter height of the scenario's default
*.gnb.cellularNic.antenna.mobility.offsetZ = 1.5m
**.nrChannelModel[*].pathLossType = "Tr36814"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
has no scenario INDOOR_FACTORY_SL; the indoor factory scenarios are TR 38.901's: set pathLossType = "Tr38901" on the channel model
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
